(7647302, 1243245, 173844, '<td valign="top">Of course all of her work is wonderful, but what stands out most for me is her social consciousness.  This image is one of the few that address that aspect of her personality.  And it is the most probing and sympathetic.  An 8 for this excellent study, replete with fine contrast and a complex, interesting composition.</td>', 'Of course all of her work is wonderful, but what stands out most for me is her social consciousness.  This image is one of the few that address that aspect of her personality.  And it is the most probing and sympathetic.  An 8 for this excellent study, replete with fine contrast and a complex, interesting composition.', '2019-11-27 08:12:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7647303, 1243231, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific image, a vertical song.</td>', 'Terrific image, a vertical song.', '2019-11-27 08:14:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7647304, 1243047, 173844, '<td valign="top">What Robert said.  A beautiful image, peaceful and quirky.  Wasn''t clear that it spoke Margaret Bourke-White to me, but maybe my own glance at her oeuvre was insufficient, so I only gave this a 7.</td>', 'What Robert said.  A beautiful image, peaceful and quirky.  Wasn''t clear that it spoke Margaret Bourke-White to me, but maybe my own glance at her oeuvre was insufficient, so I only gave this a 7.', '2019-11-27 08:20:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7647305, 1243235, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine portrait, capturing her pensiveness, and set before a lovely array of quadrilaterals.  Despite the black and white, the tones and textures feel like color.</td>', 'Fine portrait, capturing her pensiveness, and set before a lovely array of quadrilaterals.  Despite the black and white, the tones and textures feel like color.', '2019-11-27 08:26:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7647306, 1243216, 173844, '<td valign="top">The mood engendered by the play of light, contrasts and fine detail captures how I feel when I see some of my favorite MB-W photos.  I''m so taken by the magic that I''m almost unaware of the scene.  <br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.  That 9.</td>', 'The mood engendered by the play of light, contrasts and fine detail captures how I feel when I see some of my favorite MB-W photos.  I''m so taken by the magic that I''m almost unaware of the scene.  Personal favorite of the challenge.  That 9.', '2019-11-27 08:32:34.000000', NULL, 0),
