(7647336, 1242936, 19825, '<td valign="top">I saw this in voting and guessed it was another of your recent wax figure entries. Perhaps it should not be down-voted simply because it is a wax figure, but you can understand how some would put a higher value/score on a well captured portrait of a child compared to a well composed shot of a figure.</td>', 'I saw this in voting and guessed it was another of your recent wax figure entries. Perhaps it should not be down-voted simply because it is a wax figure, but you can understand how some would put a higher value/score on a well captured portrait of a child compared to a well composed shot of a figure.', '2019-11-27 11:37:48.000000', NULL, 0),
